"Suggested defaults for missing source parameters:" = "Empfohlene Vorgaben für fehlende Werte:";
"A recovery snapshot needs at least 14 days of history, 6 recent sets and recent muscle data." = "Erfordert 14 Tage Verlauf, 6 neue Sätze und Muskeldaten.";
